            "rule": "delete-sentence-object-at-eof",
            "documented": "VSCodeVim 1.32.4 textobject/textobject.ts L379-L405 takes the as EOF branch when sentenceEnd and nextSentenceBegin are both [4,0], yielding start=stop=[4,0]; L436-L452 gives is range [0,0]..[4,0], without setting LineWise. The operator wrapper L27-L37 adds one to stop, mode/modeHandler.ts L1064-L1075 clamps EOF, L1093-L1100 decreases the endpoint, and actions/operator.ts L114-L154 restores the exclusive range and writes CharacterWise registers. register/register.ts L232-L260 shifts numbered registers for the full newline-containing dis range; an empty das writes unnamed and small-delete registers without a shift. transformations/execute.ts L257-L293 preserves the unchanged editor selection after the empty deletion. Scoped to normal dis/das, START [1,13], four nonempty lines without .!? and the harness's trailing newline.",
